# No Orca in Cursor

Do not use Orca in this Cursor workspace. Global skills may appear in the available-skills list; ignore them here.

## Never engage

- `orca-cli` skill
- `orchestration` skill (Orca multi-agent coordination)
- Orca Computer Use flows for Orca-managed worktrees, terminals, handoffs, or the Orca embedded browser
- Commands via `orca`, `orca-dev`, `orca-ide`, or `$ORCA_CLI_COMMAND`
- Orca handoffs / handovers / "another worktree" / cardStatus / Orca terminal send-wait

## Use instead

- Cursor Task / subagents, Shell, MCP tools, and normal git/worktree commands
- The Desk project skills (`trading-domain`, `mcp-tools`, `compliance-research`, etc.)

## Exception

Only use Orca if the user explicitly asks for Orca in this conversation (e.g. "use orca cli", "$orca-cli").
